      <h1 class="jr-h1">Collagen for Fracture Recovery: Does It Help a Broken Bone Heal?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">The protein scaffold a bone rebuilds itself on is mostly collagen, which makes the logic of swallowing collagen after a fracture feel obvious. The trials tell a more awkward story, and this article gives you the one thing the seller pages will not: what has actually been measured in people with broken bones.</p>

